  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable and Inclusive Finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve access to finance for MSMEs through credit risk mitigation and improved credit infrastructure</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed SIF operation aims to strengthen:  (i) the Deposit and Credit Guarantee Fund (DCGF) by enhancing its capitalization, technology, and institutional capacity to expand credit guarantee coverage, improve risk management, and introduce innovative de-risking products; and  (ii) the Credit Information Center Ltd (CICL) by modernizing its technology and capacity to broaden data collection, integrate alternative sources, improve efficiency and accuracy, and enhance data security and privacy.</narrative>
  </description>
